PANEL 1 - pooled cohort test (PRIMARY RESULT)
==============================================================================
  Null: prices time-shifted under fixed signs/timestamps, one shared offset
  per draw -- preserves directional bias, return autocorrelation, and the
  cross-trader correlation of co-positioned traders.

  bad cohort (old score<=5), WINDOW B (out of sample)
