==============================================================================
PANEL 4 - drift confound check
==============================================================================
  Spearman rho(long_bias, timing z) = -0.0860  p = 0.0489
  mean long bias across traders: 0.566
  Trailing-drift removal is meant to make this ~0. A strong correlation
  would mean the score is still measuring (long bias x market drift) --
  exactly the artifact that made the old contrarian signal 96.6% short.

